 "serviceDescription": "The Regional HQ\u2019s layer represents the regional headquarters main office locations and the geographic boundaries of each  region.  FEMA\u2019s Regional Headquarters Offices manage, operate and maintain all delegated programs, functions and activities not managed, operated or maintained by FEMA\u2019s headquarters organizational units.  The FEMA Regional Offices serve as the primary organizational unit for liaison to states and local governments as well as non-governmental and private sector entities within each Regional Office's geographic area.\n\nContact email:  FEMA-MACMAPS@fema.dhs.gov",
